# INVWINVB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: a use with
# another item at level 2 (CLERK).  CTRL+U on item 3, the Hercules
# card, shows a new use of it; "IBM" typed as its host lists the items
# holding it as OK looks it up, and ENTER on item 1 chooses it and
# saves the use, noted.  Item 1's form says one thing is used with it,
# and a click on its Used with button lists the use, the card's maker
# and model on its row, and ENTER shows the use in its form, the host's
# maker and model beside its ID; ESC twice shows the item's form again.
# Its status set to D (disposed of) in edit mode is refused by the
# server while the card is used with it, the reason under the fields;
# ESC and Yes leave the form.  Used with it (ALT-C W) on item 1 lists
# the use again, and Return or release (ALT-C R) there asks to release
# it, the question naming a use, and ENTER releases it, noted, the list
# then empty.  CTRL+L adds nothing there, while CTRL+R asks for an item
# and shows a new reservation of item 2 for item 1, its host preset,
# which the list then shows.  With item 3 disposed of, "a" typed as the
# host of a new use of item 2 lists the active items holding it alone.
# The end by Exit.  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot holds the
# day of the run.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINVB.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
K DOWN DOWN CTRL-U
S NEW
# past the quantity and the holder to the host, then the date out
K TAB TAB
T IBM
K TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K ENTER
S PICK
K ENTER
S ADDED
K HOME ENTER
S HELD
M 151 DOWN MID
M 151 UP MID
S USED
K ENTER
S USEFORM
K ESC ESC
S FORM
K CTRL-E TAB
T D
K ENTER
S NODISP
K ESC Y ALT-C W ALT-C R
S ASKEND
T 2026-10-02
K ENTER
S RELEASED
# there CTRL+L adds nothing; CTRL+R reserves item 2 for item 1, the
# host preset, past the holder, the host and the contact to the date out
K CTRL-L
S NOLEND
K CTRL-R
T 2
K ENTER
S HOSTNEW
K TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-10-01
K ENTER
S HOSTRES
# item 3 disposed of; a host typed as text lists only the active items
K ESC END CTRL-E TAB
T D
K ENTER UP CTRL-U TAB TAB
T a
K ENTER
S HOSTPICK
K ESC ESC Y ALT-F X
